- `/Users/chiu.fyi/work/personal/thos/hooks/use-websocket.ts` - Client-side state management: task state, server message handlers, action callbacks returned to components
- `/Users/chiu.fyi/work/personal/thos/server/session-store.ts` - Reference pattern for the new TaskStore class (mirror its debounced/sync write approach)
- `/Users/chiu.fyi/work/personal/thos/app/dashboard/page.tsx` - Layout orchestration: wire task panel toggle, pass task props, integrate with agent selection

